                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10032-208968-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <h2><a name="AC01%3AOpenReviewPage"></a><ins>AC-01: Open Review Page</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> a carrier receives an email tender<br/>
<b>When</b> the carrier selects the Accept or Decline link<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall open the Tender Review page<br/>
<b>And</b> shall not record a response.</p>

<h2><a name="AC02%3ADisplayTenderInformation"></a><ins>AC-02: Display Tender Information</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> the Tender Review page is opened<br/>
<b>When</b> tender information is retrieved successfully<br/>
<b>Then</b> the page shall display shipment and tender details required for review.</p>

<h2><a name="AC03%3AAcceptTender"></a><ins>AC-03: Accept Tender</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> a carrier is viewing the Tender Review page<br/>
<b>When</b> the carrier selects Accept<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall record an Accept response<br/>
<b>And</b> generate a Tender Response message<br/>
<b>And</b> display a success confirmation.</p>

<h2><a name="AC04%3ADeclineTender"></a><ins>AC-04: Decline Tender</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> a carrier is viewing the Tender Review page<br/>
<b>When</b> the carrier selects Decline<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall record a Decline response<br/>
<b>And</b> generate a Tender Response message<br/>
<b>And</b> display a success confirmation.</p>

<h2><a name="AC05%3AEmailScannerValidation"></a><ins>AC-05: Email Scanner Validation</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> an email-security scanner automatically follows the email link<br/>
<b>When</b> the review page opens<br/>
<b>Then</b> no tender response shall be recorded<br/>
<b>And</b> no tender status shall be updated.</p>

<h2><a name="AC06%3APreventDuplicateResponses"></a><ins>AC-06: Prevent Duplicate Responses</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> a tender has already been accepted or declined<br/>
<b>When</b> the carrier opens the same link again<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall not create another response<br/>
<b>And</b> shall display a message indicating the tender has already been processed.</p>

<h2><a name="AC07%3AResponseMethodIdentification"></a><ins>AC-07: Response Method Identification</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> a response is submitted through the Tender Review page<br/>
<b>When</b> the Tender Response message is generated<br/>
<b>Then</b> the response method shall be set to Email.</p>

<h2><a name="AC08%3AInvalidorExpiredLink"></a><ins>AC-08: Invalid or Expired Link</ins></h2>

<p><b>Given</b> the carrier accesses an invalid or expired link<br/>
<b>When</b> the page loads<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall display an appropriate error message<br/>
<b>And</b> shall not expose shipment information<br/>
<b>And</b> shall not create a response.</p>
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Sprint:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10021-208968-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">Skybreakers Sprint 44</td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>OdysseyONE Scrum Team:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_11762-208968-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">    Skybreakers
</td>
            </tr>
